# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory and honours THIS file, not
# .gitignore — a gitignored file will still ship unless it is listed here.
design-source/

# Raw supplied artwork keeps landing in public/ and getting served: the KDC
# print ads, the logo sources, then the Dodge press shot. Naming each file
# individually loses that race every time.
#
# Every asset the site actually uses lives in a subdirectory — public/logos/
# or public/prizes/ — and everything legitimately at the top level of public/
# is an SVG. So no top-level raster image is ever wanted.
public/*.png
public/*.jpg
public/*.jpeg
public/*.webp
public/*.gif

**/API keys.txt
.env*
!.env.example
